        {
          "text": "Iyokyi ng’olyot bik tugul che kigeluul, ilenji, Kamwa Jehovah agobo Semaia Neelamindet, ko u ni kole: Amu kigomaotenwok Semaia, ak kima ayogu, ak kogogonok omang’u lembeita; ",
